This telecom transaction dataset enables the business to measure 
how refill behavior changes with price variation.

By calculating price elasticity, the company can:

- Predict impact of price changes
- Avoid revenue loss
- Optimize pricing strategy
- Increase profitability
- Support data-driven decision making

